	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg33597"></a>
		<table width="100%" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed;">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="16%" rowspan="2" style="overflow: hidden;">
							<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=3" title="View the profile of Fuzed">Fuzed</a></b>
							<div class="smalltext">
								Administrator<br />
								Sr. Member<br />
								<img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 432<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=3"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</div>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2916.msg33597#msg33597"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2916.msg33597#msg33597">Re: Soundexchange, Pro Fusion, royalties, etc</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> July 19, 2007, 12:16:50 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">cool, glad it helps. Read everything on this issue with a very cynical mind. Most writers are just repeating what they read somewhere else, and have little or no knowledge about this very complex issue. So there is a lot of misinformation, especially in the hip hip hop world, where some influential folks have been spreading info that isn&#039;t all correct, but sounds really bad. As with most things, take the time to educate yourself and look deeper. This is about your business if you are an artist, and so ultimately about taking care of your art, your family and yourself. Many of the people writing about this are webcasters themselves, and don&#039;t have the best interest of musicians in mind.</div>
